{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_01-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>釀成168人死亡、1984戶痛失家園的宏福苑大火，今（26日）一周年，大批市民從早上開始陸續前往悼念，宏福苑前的廣福公園再度放滿鮮花，當中亦有祭品，包括玩具及毛公仔，有市民除了留下字條，亦放下照片，寄語：「願陽光每日都伴著每位宏福人」。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>不少在大火中一夜失去致親與家園的居民亦有到場，其間有居民獲准進入宏福苑內哀悼，另於大火中失去準媳婦的宏泰閣居民李太，以及拒絕出售業權的宏泰閣居民歐太亦與街坊在公園內悼念。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_05-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_12-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_10-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_06-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_07-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p>到場致哀的居民許多都帶備鮮花，亦有市民懷抱頭盔向殉職消防員何偉豪致意，市民離遠憑弔宏福苑，神情哀傷，部分相擁痛哭。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_08-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_02-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_03-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_11-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>截至傍晚7時許，仍有市民陸續前來，暫時未見排隊人龍，主要在公園內聚集默哀悼念。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_04-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4_09-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:04:07.378117+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":14,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:42:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:12.857539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:57:14.458301+00:00","content_hash":"db7477f23db8ac707386a0fc4506cea82bc6c83061d49067078a871c98bf6b2c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}